                       "ownerCluster":  3,
                       "rationale":  "PPE is named by three units. CPCCCM2012 Work safely at heights, delivered first in Term 3, carries the fullest statement of it - selection, fitting AND use - because fall-arrest equipment is the case where fitting actually decides whether the equipment works. Teaching it there gives the plastering units a fitted-PPE standard to apply rather than a second, thinner account of the same thing.",
