                       "rationale":  "Both Term 4 units cite the NCC and Australian Standards. The TAS delivery sequence puts CPCCCO2013 before CPCCVE1011, so the concreting unit introduces what the Code is, how a Standard is called up by it, and how to find the clause that governs a task. The capstone project unit then applies it. NOTE: the detector suggested CPCCVE1011 because it sits earlier in the TAS unit TABLE; the delivery sequence is the authority and it says otherwise.",
